WEBVTT

00:05.600 --> 00:09.650
DOGS AND RAINDROPS, PART 1

00:10.280 --> 00:11.940
So it started raining after all.

00:12.240 --> 00:13.070
Kanshi.

00:13.070 --> 00:14.610
Yeah, I'll be right back.

00:18.280 --> 00:20.080
Where's Kan going?

00:20.080 --> 00:22.200
On rainy days,
we have a look around the school.

00:22.620 --> 00:24.790
Let's not make any side trips today
and go straight home.

00:26.250 --> 00:27.750
<i>Ms. Ibuki's prophecy...</i>

00:28.130 --> 00:31.010
<i>Dogs, raindrops, school...</i>

00:31.590 --> 00:35.180
<i>We need to be especially cautious at school
on rainy days, and can't let our guard down.</i>

00:35.680 --> 00:39.850
<i>The enemy uses magic, so they probably
won't suddenly show up and attack.</i>

00:41.350 --> 00:43.640
You're Nico Wakatsuki
and Morihito Otogi, right?

00:45.020 --> 00:47.150
Who're you, huh?

00:47.770 --> 00:50.320
I am a witch.

00:50.480 --> 00:52.190
She did suddenly show up!

00:55.030 --> 00:56.450
Ouch.

00:56.740 --> 01:00.410
You didn't do what I asked
so you had to get hurt.

01:00.410 --> 01:01.740
Hurry up and take those off.

01:01.740 --> 01:04.580
Those rare sneakers
are practically wasted on you.

01:04.870 --> 01:08.960
You're Muto, right?
We went to the same middle school.

01:08.960 --> 01:11.000
You weren't like this at all back then.

01:12.300 --> 01:14.380
You can say it's my high school debut.

01:14.380 --> 01:17.220
I've been reborn.

01:17.430 --> 01:20.300
Hey, you wanna try some of this, too?

01:20.930 --> 01:25.310
I've got some great medicine, you see.
It amplifies your power and desires.

01:25.310 --> 01:28.980
If there's something you want to do,
you can make that happen with sheer force.

01:30.560 --> 01:31.730
No thanks.

01:32.070 --> 01:36.490
All right. Then, give me those sneakers!

01:36.950 --> 01:38.490
What's wrong with you?

01:38.700 --> 01:39.990
Kanshi?

01:40.160 --> 01:41.950
That hurt!

01:42.200 --> 01:43.490
Apologize to Keigo.

01:43.660 --> 01:45.870
Who the hell're you?

01:45.960 --> 01:48.250
I'm sorry!

01:48.250 --> 01:50.380
Cut me down! Please!

01:50.380 --> 01:52.550
Really? Sure. I'll get a blade.

01:52.550 --> 01:55.970
I'm not some kind of fish!
Why're you being so scary?

01:55.970 --> 01:57.760
Are you all right, Keigo?

01:58.180 --> 02:00.470
Huh? What do you mean?

02:00.470 --> 02:03.510
It's not like I was about to get hunted
for my sneakers or anything.

02:03.510 --> 02:05.100
Don't be a poser.

02:06.430 --> 02:09.520
I was really scared! Thank you, Kanshi.

02:09.520 --> 02:11.020
Your name's Muto?

02:11.230 --> 02:12.650
What is this?

02:12.860 --> 02:14.530
Where did you get it from?

02:15.280 --> 02:18.820
That's a candy called "drops."

02:18.820 --> 02:21.780
It's rumored to remove inhibitions.

02:21.990 --> 02:24.450
MEMBER
INFORMATION

02:21.990 --> 02:24.450
NAME

02:21.990 --> 02:24.450
ADDRESS

02:21.990 --> 02:26.540
You enter your address on this secret
website and they get mailed to you for free.

02:26.750 --> 02:31.040
We can just report
such a dangerous drug to the police, right?

02:31.040 --> 02:32.790
It'll be useless to do that.

02:33.250 --> 02:36.050
If someone examines it,
they won't find any dangerous substances.

02:36.380 --> 02:38.920
Because it's just a normal candy
that you can buy anywhere!

02:39.180 --> 02:40.340
Normal candy?

02:40.590 --> 02:43.390
That's ridiculous. Then what's with
the removing inhibitions part?

02:43.390 --> 02:45.720
How the hell should I know?

02:46.430 --> 02:49.390
<i>Why would they use normal candy?</i>

02:49.980 --> 02:51.440
<i>Group hypnosis?</i>

02:52.060 --> 02:54.650
<i>No. Is this magic?</i>

02:55.230 --> 02:56.860
Who's distributing these drops?

02:56.980 --> 02:59.780
S-Some guy named Wolf.

02:59.780 --> 03:05.280
He's probably one of the students, but no one
knows his real name or what grade he's in.

03:05.280 --> 03:09.370
He just sends us things through the mail.
Like if we run out, we can just order more.

03:09.370 --> 03:11.710
And that we'll meet up
somewhere on school grounds.

03:11.960 --> 03:13.330
<i>Just on school grounds?</i>

03:13.540 --> 03:16.920
<i>So he's not after money.
What's he trying to do?</i>

03:18.130 --> 03:21.720
Everyone who uses the drops
knows how scary that guy is.

03:21.720 --> 03:25.680
If Wolf wants to summon us,
then we all gather!

03:27.600 --> 03:30.230
I've heard the rumors, too.

03:30.430 --> 03:34.810
People using these drops
and being reckless are called "Dogs."

03:34.810 --> 03:37.400
What? Did you say "Dogs"?

03:39.530 --> 03:40.780
This isn't much, but...

03:40.950 --> 03:42.110
Oh, thank you.

03:42.110 --> 03:44.990
Hey, Nemu. Isn't this house huge?

03:44.990 --> 03:48.540
Moi's grandfather expanded it
for his students,

03:48.540 --> 03:53.210
so there's lots of rooms
and even a bath upstairs.

03:52.620 --> 03:55.290
<i>Yes, I've already been in the bath.</i>

03:53.210 --> 03:55.290
Maybe you can sleep over sometime, too.

03:55.290 --> 03:57.800
Nico, that's enough chatting for now.

03:58.750 --> 04:00.380
You knew about her, Nico?

04:00.380 --> 04:02.590
That there's a witch family
in the next town over.

04:02.590 --> 04:08.140
Yeah, my mom told me about
the elite witch family, the Miyao Family.

04:08.350 --> 04:12.600
But I didn't know
there was such a cute witch girl!

04:13.020 --> 04:14.480
It's nice to meet you, Nemu!

04:15.980 --> 04:18.940
<i>I've already met you, though.</i>

04:19.230 --> 04:22.440
<i>I can't say that they took turns
petting me as a cat.</i>

04:22.570 --> 04:24.820
I still can't trust you, though.

04:25.110 --> 04:26.780
We have enemies that are after Nico.

04:27.280 --> 04:30.700
And I have to be cautious
because you could be one of them.

04:30.790 --> 04:34.290
I see. Ibuki Wakatsuki is an oracle,

04:34.460 --> 04:36.580
and it seems like
there's already been a prophecy.

04:36.670 --> 04:38.380
Do you know about the enemy?

04:38.630 --> 04:41.300
Yesterday, for the first time
in my life, my Alert rang out.

04:41.760 --> 04:45.050
It's a spell that warns you
when a warlock is nearby.

04:45.970 --> 04:47.220
Warlock?

04:47.220 --> 04:48.720
You don't know anything?

04:48.720 --> 04:51.640
My mother did tell me about the Alert spell.

04:51.970 --> 04:54.230
In witchcraft, there's white and black.

04:54.520 --> 04:57.310
The witch, who uses white magic
to uphold justice.

04:57.560 --> 05:00.270
The warlock, who uses black magic for evil.

05:00.650 --> 05:03.530
They've been in opposition since ages past,

05:03.530 --> 05:06.820
and there was even a great battle
in Japan that happened a long time ago.

05:06.820 --> 05:10.030
In the end, the warlocks were all defeated.

05:10.450 --> 05:14.910
Since then, in order to recognize
when a warlock appears,

05:14.910 --> 05:18.790
all witches have the Alert spell
cast on them.

05:19.380 --> 05:20.790
So they won't fall to the darker side.

05:21.420 --> 05:24.170
We're also taught this
at a young age thoroughly.

05:24.510 --> 05:27.470
Because of this, there should be
no warlocks in the present time.

05:27.800 --> 05:31.720
Or so we thought, but it's not that strange
for white to go black

05:31.720 --> 05:34.680
because of their mental state
or external stimulation.

05:35.060 --> 05:37.480
They could blend in within human society,

05:37.480 --> 05:40.270
or it's also possible
to use magic and hide themselves.

05:40.440 --> 05:42.900
And you're saying
that Alert rang yesterday.

05:43.110 --> 05:45.190
I didn't see what they looked like,

05:45.360 --> 05:48.160
but they were plotting something
with a man in a run-down house.

05:49.280 --> 05:51.830
Saying, "Capture Nico Wakatsuki."

05:52.990 --> 05:54.950
Why is Nico even being targeted?

05:55.160 --> 05:58.750
Do you not know how powerful she is
by being around her?

05:59.500 --> 06:02.000
How powerful...

06:02.420 --> 06:03.840
Ms. Nico Wakatsuki.

06:03.840 --> 06:05.300
Just call me Nico.

06:06.300 --> 06:10.090
Nico, you possess an unbelievable
amount of magic power.

06:10.550 --> 06:13.350
The enemy is most likely after that.

06:14.140 --> 06:16.180
Nico Wakatsuki is the Witch of Thousands.

06:16.480 --> 06:19.690
She possesses 1,000 spells,
and will save 1,000 people.

06:20.150 --> 06:22.860
A special witch that comes
once in a thousand years.

06:23.320 --> 06:26.860
The Witch of Thousands.

06:30.700 --> 06:32.780
It stopped raining.

06:33.410 --> 06:35.830
<i>The rain had nothing to do with this.</i>

06:37.000 --> 06:40.120
Looks like you had some fun
with one of my pets.

06:40.250 --> 06:43.420
So you're Wolf? You look pretty gruff.

06:43.420 --> 06:47.670
I thought you'd be a cute old lady since
I heard you were passing out candy.

06:49.760 --> 06:51.220
Let's go somewhere else.

06:51.220 --> 06:54.510
Oh my, what an aggressive invitation.

06:55.470 --> 06:56.640
But I don't hate it.

07:05.320 --> 07:07.110
You're not that bad.

07:07.490 --> 07:09.320
You're pretty strong.

07:11.110 --> 07:14.160
<i>What's with this guy? He's not normal.</i>

07:15.030 --> 07:16.950
<i>Is it the effects from that candy?</i>

07:17.370 --> 07:20.920
<i>Candy... Drops... Rain drops.</i>

07:22.210 --> 07:23.250
<i>Rain.</i>

07:23.920 --> 07:27.050
<i>"Dogs and Raindrops." So he's the disaster!</i>

07:27.800 --> 07:31.800
Tell Morihito Otogi that he's next.

07:31.970 --> 07:33.050
Wait.

07:33.340 --> 07:36.560
You know about us. Who are you?

07:36.810 --> 07:40.890
Give up already.
You can't beat me in a fist fight.

07:40.980 --> 07:42.690
It's because of the candy, huh?

07:42.850 --> 07:46.650
I can't lose to a guy who's been doped up.

07:46.820 --> 07:51.570
I need to prove that tengu are strong,
or else Pops will be pissed!

07:53.240 --> 07:56.870
<i>Morihito is a good guy,
but I don't want to lose to him.</i>

07:56.870 --> 08:00.040
<i>And Nico and I cheered each other on
during our training days.</i>

08:00.160 --> 08:02.290
<i>I'm gonna protect them!</i>

08:02.410 --> 08:06.290
And what are you shouldering, huh?
Tell me!

08:06.630 --> 08:10.920
You smell real good now.
Come at me, then!

08:11.260 --> 08:13.050
<i>He disappeared? Where did he go?</i>

08:14.510 --> 08:18.430
<i>A tengu's cloak. Put it on,
and you disappear for seven seconds.</i>

08:19.310 --> 08:20.640
He ran away.

08:20.640 --> 08:23.310
Of course not, you idiot!

08:23.310 --> 08:26.690
I need to get you at least once
or else I won't be satisfied.

08:27.270 --> 08:31.280
Yeah, you're pretty good.
I've never felt like this before.

08:31.490 --> 08:35.410
My reason to fight?
It makes my blood boil, and that's it!

08:35.660 --> 08:37.280
You damn battle freak.

08:39.620 --> 08:42.200
I think you may not
know about a lot of things

08:42.200 --> 08:46.290
because your mother didn't want to put
unnecessary stress on you.

08:46.580 --> 08:49.000
Because anxiety and fear
give birth to warlocks.

08:56.140 --> 08:57.430
Moi.

08:58.010 --> 09:01.060
Will my magic hurt people?

09:02.680 --> 09:03.810
Ms. Nemu Miyao.

09:04.850 --> 09:08.400
Do you tell everyone around you
that you're a witch?

09:08.400 --> 09:14.150
No. In the past, it seems we were more open
about it, but nowadays we keep it a secret.

09:14.150 --> 09:17.570
Even my mother's work is a secret business
that only her valued clients know.

09:18.780 --> 09:22.700
When Nico was a child, she told
her friends that she was a witch.

09:23.160 --> 09:26.710
As a result, she was feared
and went through some tough times.

09:27.420 --> 09:30.340
In the end, she accidentally destroyed
half her house because of it.

09:32.130 --> 09:34.300
I grew up in a similar situation,

09:34.300 --> 09:38.220
but thanks to Ogre Qigong training,
I'm able to stay mentally stable.

09:38.840 --> 09:43.220
But I think Nico has always been
afraid of her own power.

09:43.770 --> 09:46.390
Back then, I wasn't able
to fully protect her,

09:46.390 --> 09:48.650
and that guilt has been a thorn
stabbing at my side.

09:49.190 --> 09:50.480
Moi.

09:50.810 --> 09:55.740
But this time, I'll protect you, Nico.
So don't worry.

09:58.360 --> 09:59.240
Okay.

09:59.370 --> 10:02.080
Oh, let me bring some snacks.

10:03.330 --> 10:06.370
<i>Huh? Is this what a witch
and familiar are like?</i>

10:06.660 --> 10:09.330
<i>Does it really have this many
"I'll protect you" vibes going for it?</i>

10:09.330 --> 10:12.130
<i>You're kidding me,
I want something like this, too.</i>

10:13.880 --> 10:15.010
What was that sound?

10:17.970 --> 10:19.010
Oh no!

10:19.260 --> 10:20.640
- Kanshi!
- Kan!

10:25.100 --> 10:27.810
<i>Healing magic
is the most difficult form of magic.</i>

10:28.060 --> 10:30.100
<i>The older the wound is,
the harder it is to heal,</i>

10:30.100 --> 10:33.980
<i>and trying to heal new wounds
still consumes a lot of magic power.</i>

10:35.440 --> 10:38.400
Thanks, the pain is already receding.

10:38.400 --> 10:41.820
I'm sorry. It looks like this is my limit.

10:41.820 --> 10:42.660
Are you all right?

10:44.030 --> 10:45.580
I prepared some snacks.

10:46.750 --> 10:48.750
<i>Familiars are so great.</i>

10:50.170 --> 10:50.920
Wolf?

10:51.040 --> 10:54.670
Who is that guy?
And why did he beat you up like this?

10:54.670 --> 10:59.180
I understand the prophecy now.
He's definitely the one who's after Nico.

10:59.680 --> 11:04.010
And then, I think the one behind him
is an enchanter.

11:04.010 --> 11:07.770
I've been wondering,
but why is there a super pretty girl here?

11:07.770 --> 11:09.270
This is Ms. Nemu Miyao.

11:09.270 --> 11:13.020
She's also a witch, and she found out
about Nico's danger and came to tell us.

11:13.230 --> 11:14.190
Pardon the intrusion.

11:14.440 --> 11:17.280
Oh! It's nice to meet you.

11:16.980 --> 11:17.940
THIRD TIME HERE

11:18.690 --> 11:22.950
Enchanters specialize
in imbuing objects with magic.

11:23.410 --> 11:25.950
I think they changed the candy
into magical medicine

11:25.950 --> 11:29.080
so they can create humans to control.

11:29.410 --> 11:33.080
It's difficult to imbue a lot of magic at once,

11:33.080 --> 11:36.550
but if you mix it in with candy,
and slowly consume it, then it's possible.

11:37.250 --> 11:40.170
If you get a large amount of people
to consume it over a period of time,

11:40.170 --> 11:42.340
then you can create a puppet army.

11:42.840 --> 11:44.890
The man named Wolf
is probably the first experiment

11:44.890 --> 11:47.470
for creating a more powerful
and brainwashed person.

11:47.810 --> 11:50.520
He'll grow his army
through violence and fear,

11:50.520 --> 11:53.690
and once the magic gets through to everyone,
that's when the witch controls them.

11:54.400 --> 11:57.020
And they're all gonna attack Nico, huh?

11:57.360 --> 12:01.490
Yeah, because if the warlock gets close,
the Alert will go off,

12:01.490 --> 12:03.320
so they're using humans.

12:03.780 --> 12:05.530
I understand what I have to do now.

12:05.870 --> 12:08.910
Ms. Miyao, can you tell us where you found
that run-down house?

12:09.120 --> 12:10.870
It might be the warlock's hideout.

12:11.120 --> 12:15.500
I wasn't paying attention that time,
so I don't know where exactly it is.

12:16.000 --> 12:18.340
But I understand,
I'll look for it once more.

12:19.300 --> 12:21.300
Kanshi, you stay home and rest.

12:21.590 --> 12:23.680
Nico and I will go to school tomorrow.

12:23.880 --> 12:25.390
Wouldn't that be dangerous?

12:25.510 --> 12:27.680
Nico will be safer if she's with me.

12:28.100 --> 12:31.060
Stay by my side and don't ever leave.

12:32.850 --> 12:34.310
Okay, got it!

12:35.600 --> 12:37.060
He's quite coolheaded.

12:37.650 --> 12:39.320
Does he seem like that to you?

12:39.320 --> 12:40.150
What?

12:42.320 --> 12:45.360
I'm sorry! I'll give back the money
that I stole!

12:45.700 --> 12:46.740
Where...

12:46.990 --> 12:48.120
Huh? It's right here.

12:48.530 --> 12:50.490
Where's Wolf?

12:53.540 --> 12:58.000
MORIHITO EXCHANGED
HIS PRECIOUS CASH TO FIX THE WALL
"WITCH RECOVERY!"

12:58.290 --> 13:00.130
Get back here, you drop addict!

13:00.340 --> 13:03.420
Damn it, I don't know anything
about Wolf.

13:03.420 --> 13:06.220
Okay, let me back you up!

13:06.220 --> 13:10.930
Go, new spell!
Slime Lotion Gel Amoebas!

13:12.520 --> 13:13.730
Slippery!

13:13.730 --> 13:15.350
Hey, don't interfere!

13:16.730 --> 13:21.480
Looks like you didn't know that
I went to skating classes when I was a kid!

13:21.480 --> 13:23.030
How the hell could we know?

13:23.610 --> 13:24.950
Keigo Magami?

13:25.320 --> 13:29.910
Looks like you didn't know
that I was a former figure skater!

13:30.160 --> 13:32.370
Okay, hold him down just like that!

13:33.910 --> 13:36.460
I have intel that tells me
you saw this Wolf guy.

13:36.670 --> 13:38.290
Tell me everything you know.

13:38.290 --> 13:41.500
I-I only saw him once.

13:41.710 --> 13:45.930
He was beating up a guy who tried
to resell the drops. Then he said to me...

13:46.090 --> 13:48.930
<i>Go tell the other Dogs what you just saw.</i>

13:49.010 --> 13:50.050
Yeah.

13:50.050 --> 13:52.310
<i>Setting an example to spread fear.</i>

13:52.430 --> 13:55.430
That's all I know.

13:55.520 --> 13:57.140
What did his face look like?

13:57.140 --> 13:59.520
Huh? Something like this.

13:59.520 --> 14:02.070
So you never went to art classes, huh?

14:02.190 --> 14:05.610
Oh yeah, he said something
to me at the end.

14:06.280 --> 14:08.570
<i>I'm going to call for a summons soon.</i>

14:08.990 --> 14:11.120
I can go now, right?

14:12.950 --> 14:16.210
You being a figure skater
really helped us out.

14:16.500 --> 14:18.250
You're really good
at sliding away from things.

14:18.250 --> 14:19.960
Am I being dissed right now?

14:20.210 --> 14:25.420
I heard everything from Kanshi.
He got all beat up because he saved me.

14:25.920 --> 14:28.470
Can you please let me help you guys out?

14:28.550 --> 14:32.470
We're thankful for your offer, but there's
a witch working in the background.

14:32.600 --> 14:34.060
Best not to get involved.

14:34.970 --> 14:37.980
I got connected to Wolf
through text messages.

14:38.270 --> 14:39.310
What did you say?

14:39.560 --> 14:42.190
I entered in my address at that one website.

14:42.480 --> 14:46.860
I know it's risky,
but now it's easier to get information.

14:46.860 --> 14:48.490
Why would you do such a dangerous...

14:48.490 --> 14:50.910
Why are you going that far for us?

14:52.070 --> 14:55.200
After I quit skating,
I was basically a piece of shit.

14:55.950 --> 15:00.460
When I was a second year in middle school,
Mom drove us to an important tournament.

15:00.460 --> 15:04.130
We got in an accident,
and my leg got really injured.

15:04.550 --> 15:09.760
It doesn't affect my daily life, but
I retired from competing because of it.

15:10.220 --> 15:13.220
After I quit, I didn't feel like doing anything.

15:13.850 --> 15:18.520
I was just staying inside my own little world,
and thought I didn't need friends.

15:19.440 --> 15:22.350
And before I realized it,
I became this lonely hipster guy.

15:22.350 --> 15:23.690
He called himself that.

15:24.320 --> 15:29.450
But lately, after hanging around you guys,
things have been fun again.

15:29.860 --> 15:33.490
It makes me really nervous to say this,
but you're...

15:34.450 --> 15:38.450
m-my friends.

15:38.910 --> 15:43.420
And if you could find it in yourselves
to trust me, then I'd like to help you out.

15:44.420 --> 15:45.460
All right.

15:45.710 --> 15:49.010
If any information comes in,
let us know, Keigo.

15:52.300 --> 15:53.340
It's from Nemu.

15:53.340 --> 15:57.220
HELLO, THIS IS MORIHITO OTOGI.
MY APOLOGIES FOR SUDDENLY
VISITING YOUR HOUSE EARLIER.

I STILL CANNOT FIND THE RUN-DOWN HOUSE.
I'M SORRY THAT MY MEMORY IS SO FUZZY.
TOMORROW IS MY DAY OFF,
SO I HOPE TO CONTINUE MY SEARCH.

15:53.890 --> 15:56.260
She still can't find that run-down house,

15:56.890 --> 15:58.890
but she'll keep looking tomorrow.

15:58.890 --> 16:03.230
I'm really grateful that Nemu and Keigo
are helping us out.

16:03.940 --> 16:06.230
I wonder what I can do, too.

16:07.150 --> 16:08.730
<i>Nemu had told me.</i>

16:09.400 --> 16:13.320
<i>It's forbidden to use magic with hostility,
so witches in training</i>

16:13.320 --> 16:15.120
<i>have a limiter placed on them.</i>

16:15.450 --> 16:18.740
<i>That means Nico can't participate
in the fight with her magic.</i>

16:19.450 --> 16:22.710
<i>Makes you really understand why witches
use tengu and ogres as guards.</i>

16:24.880 --> 16:27.500
<i>I've searched this much
and still can't find anything.</i>

16:27.840 --> 16:29.380
<i>What I can think of is...</i>

16:29.920 --> 16:33.630
<i>That space was created by magic.</i>

16:33.970 --> 16:37.760
<i>If there's magic that can create such a space,
then you can place the door anywhere you want.</i>

16:37.930 --> 16:41.140
<i>Somewhere a human wouldn't normally touch.</i>

16:41.520 --> 16:44.400
<i>Like in a lower position
on a telephone pole or a wall.</i>

16:44.600 --> 16:48.570
<i>What if my cat self coincidentally touched it
and went through it?</i>

16:51.740 --> 16:54.530
<i>I should be looking for a sigil of a door.</i>

17:03.790 --> 17:07.710
Taking advantage
of this pocket space to go wild, eh?

17:07.710 --> 17:09.420
Are you getting restless?

17:09.420 --> 17:13.300
It's because you make me do
boring work like gathering Dogs.

17:14.840 --> 17:17.050
Soon, that will come to an end.

17:17.220 --> 17:22.140
Bring those 50 Dogs
along with Nico Wakatsuki.

17:22.350 --> 17:24.100
We commence tonight!

17:25.520 --> 17:27.310
<i>Oh no, tonight?</i>

17:34.650 --> 17:37.160
Oh look, a kitten has wandered in.

17:37.570 --> 17:39.950
You're a witch, aren't you?

17:40.240 --> 17:42.410
But why are you a cat?

17:43.120 --> 17:45.580
I see, from the Miyao Family.

17:46.330 --> 17:52.340
What was a witch doing here?
Is she connected with Nico Wakatsuki?

17:53.380 --> 17:54.470
I'll have to kill her.

17:56.880 --> 17:59.390
What, are you going to stop me?

17:59.390 --> 18:01.850
It's my choice if I want to save a cat or not.

18:01.850 --> 18:04.640
I have nothing to do with the battle
between the white and black.

18:04.810 --> 18:07.600
You're quite the cheeky one
for a being a familiar.

18:07.600 --> 18:08.940
<i>A familiar?</i>

18:16.110 --> 18:18.320
It's a pill imbued with magic.

18:18.320 --> 18:21.910
I'm having her fall asleep so she won't
get in the way of our plan.

18:22.160 --> 18:25.040
So she returns back to normal
if she falls asleep?

18:25.040 --> 18:28.790
Just toss her somewhere.
I need to seal this area.

18:29.710 --> 18:32.670
Now, let us begin our plan.

18:32.670 --> 18:35.550
Gather the Dogs and make them attack
Nico Wakatsuki.

18:35.840 --> 18:38.430
You'll be dealing with that ogre.

18:38.430 --> 18:43.350
Finally. I've been waiting to fight that ogre!

18:45.060 --> 18:47.810
A berserker, just as the legends say.

18:47.810 --> 18:50.690
<i>They have a wolf familiar.</i>

18:53.860 --> 18:57.110
They're going to control the students
and make them attack me.

18:57.490 --> 18:59.820
It's quite the large-scale operation.

18:59.820 --> 19:06.000
They'll use the Dogs to attack Nico,
and probably have Wolf fight Morihito.

19:06.580 --> 19:09.290
Morihito, Wolf is strong.

19:09.290 --> 19:12.040
If you fight him one-on-one,
you might be evenly matched.

19:12.040 --> 19:16.460
You went with a strategy that you don't
specialize in, and went for a fist fight.

19:16.460 --> 19:19.970
And you did it for me,
so you can see how strong he is.

19:20.630 --> 19:25.970
No, I was probably just being stubborn.
Didn't know he'd be that strong.

19:26.890 --> 19:28.350
We have a winning chance.

19:28.680 --> 19:32.730
Wolf has confidence in one-on-one fights,
so if we were to make him lose...

19:33.060 --> 19:34.980
It would be by fighting him together.

19:35.190 --> 19:38.440
So Nico, please support me
with your magic.

19:38.690 --> 19:41.490
He should get scared
if he sees us working together.

19:42.030 --> 19:44.450
I'm going to support Moi?

19:45.280 --> 19:46.490
Okay, I'll do it!

19:46.700 --> 19:49.000
Kanshi, you look for the enchanter.

19:49.000 --> 19:52.630
If we neutralize her, then that should
dispel the effect on the Dogs.

19:52.630 --> 19:54.000
All right, got it!

19:55.590 --> 19:56.500
It's Keigo.

19:56.880 --> 19:59.260
There it is. Wolf called for a summon.

19:59.260 --> 20:03.840
The Dogs are gathering at Kojo Park.
And then they're gonna head here.

20:03.970 --> 20:05.220
So it finally started, huh?

20:06.560 --> 20:09.100
- It's a raid!
- Capture the witch, Nico!

20:09.100 --> 20:10.480
Kill the ogre!

20:12.650 --> 20:14.060
Moi, what should we do?

20:14.060 --> 20:15.360
We won't let them get here.

20:15.560 --> 20:18.230
We'll go to them,
and move according to our plan.

20:18.230 --> 20:19.780
Follow me, I'll take you there.

20:19.780 --> 20:20.990
Thanks, Keigo.

20:21.280 --> 20:22.740
Let's go! It's the final battle!

20:22.990 --> 20:24.910
I-I'm getting really nervous.

20:24.910 --> 20:28.160
This is finally it, we're storming the castle!
I'm shaking in my boots.

20:28.580 --> 20:29.620
You know...

20:30.330 --> 20:34.500
Being born as a tengu,
I've always wanted to be normal.

20:34.920 --> 20:36.880
I never wanted this power.

20:37.840 --> 20:38.500
Yeah.

20:38.750 --> 20:40.880
But then, by watching you...

20:41.340 --> 20:43.970
I realized that power is meant
to be used for other people.

20:44.180 --> 20:46.720
If you're going to use
your magic to help other people,

20:46.720 --> 20:49.390
then I'll use my power
to help you.

20:49.390 --> 20:50.890
And that time has come.

20:51.310 --> 20:52.270
So don't worry!

20:53.600 --> 20:54.440
Yeah.

20:57.230 --> 20:59.280
The moon is getting blurry.

20:59.530 --> 21:04.360
Morihito, if you get injured,
can Nico heal you with her magic?

21:04.360 --> 21:08.280
Nico can use magic
that aids a person's recovery.

21:08.830 --> 21:12.290
So she can mostly fix newly
made wounds, and that's about it.

21:13.210 --> 21:15.960
I asked about the injury
you got from the past,

21:16.250 --> 21:20.670
but healing old wounds is a different kind
of magic that she can't do.

21:20.880 --> 21:25.050
Huh? What?
Awe, I didn't say anything like that.

21:25.050 --> 21:28.640
It has nothing to do with me, and
I don't have any regrets about ice skating.

21:27.050 --> 21:29.390
I see. Sorry.

21:29.560 --> 21:30.430
Whoa, woops.

21:31.470 --> 21:35.190
Sorry, my shoe lace got untied,
so go ahead without me.

21:35.350 --> 21:36.310
- Okay.
- All right.

21:44.950 --> 21:45.950
Huh?

21:46.740 --> 21:48.700
Where are Morihito and Keigo?

22:00.250 --> 22:01.550
Thank you...

22:01.960 --> 22:03.760
for trusting in me.

22:04.550 --> 22:09.800
I have to be aware of team ups,
so I needed to split you guys up.

22:10.140 --> 22:11.640
I can win if it's just us.

22:11.930 --> 22:15.140
Keigo Magami. What are you...

22:18.850 --> 22:20.610
You're Keigo Magami, right?

22:21.360 --> 22:24.650
What is this?
What did you do to me, old man?

22:26.450 --> 22:28.360
This is my puppet.

22:28.660 --> 22:31.740
I need your strength for a certain plan.

22:32.080 --> 22:34.500
Make a contract with me as a familiar.

22:34.620 --> 22:36.870
What? I have no idea what you're saying.

22:37.000 --> 22:39.420
Of course, this won't be for free.

22:39.670 --> 22:42.380
I can grant you one wish.

22:42.840 --> 22:44.880
I am a witch, you see.

22:50.890 --> 22:54.140
There's a wish that I really need granted.

22:54.470 --> 22:56.600
When witches are born,

22:56.600 --> 23:00.310
there's a custom to make a cure-all
medicine from their umbilical chord.

23:00.560 --> 23:04.150
It's something you can use once
when you have a dire emergency.

23:04.440 --> 23:09.450
When the plan is complete,
I'll give you my bottle.

23:09.700 --> 23:11.160
I signed a contract with her.

23:11.320 --> 23:16.660
Either the enchanter dies,
or I die when I disobey her orders.

23:17.250 --> 23:21.210
And so, for the sake of the plan, I got close
to you, and had you put your faith in me.

23:21.210 --> 23:23.040
Are you from a family of familiars?

23:23.500 --> 23:27.800
It's a story from long ago that
if we look at the full moon, we transform.

23:27.800 --> 23:32.180
But nowadays, werewolves transform
when we look at any crescent shape.

23:32.550 --> 23:33.850
A werewolf!

23:39.270 --> 23:41.060
Ogres lost their horns,

23:41.060 --> 23:43.020
and tengu lost their wings.

23:43.020 --> 23:45.900
Werewolves don't become wolves.

23:46.610 --> 23:49.860
We get stronger, more aggressive,

23:50.030 --> 23:52.490
and become a totally different person.

23:57.700 --> 24:00.580
I'm ain't scared of no wolf,
nope, no wolf.

24:00.580 --> 24:02.080
No, no, hold on.

24:02.080 --> 24:04.630
Things are getting pretty serious,
so it's not that kind of atmosphere.

24:04.630 --> 24:08.170
What? I can't joke around? You gotta tell me
beforehand, I feel so embarrassed.

24:06.920 --> 24:12.010
NEXT EPISODE
DOGS AND RAINDROPS, PART 2

24:08.170 --> 24:10.970
Next episode, "Dogs and Raindrops, Part 2."
Please look forward to it.

24:10.970 --> 24:12.010
Oh, she flubbed it.
